WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
This is Richai’s check-in record

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,320
Overtime approval form

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,680
And Joo Hyun-sam is forced to work overtime

4
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:06,400
The recording of harsh wage deductions is required by all of you according to the labor law.

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,920
Compensation of 85,642 yuan

6
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,880
We are here to check out today. As for beating people

7
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,160
It was Joo Hyun-san who insulted me first

8
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,440
We just restrained him in self-defense

9
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,440
If you want money, go get the injury checked.

10
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,560
Just remove it if you are being monitored

11
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,760
You two are planning to make things big, okay?

12
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,280
Zhao Wancai, 48 years old

13
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,280
Arrive in Beijing at the age of nineteen

14
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,480
I carried bags at the dock for three years

15
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,600
I registered my first company at the age of twenty-seven, and the first pot of gold came from my partners.

16
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,760
The money of 170,000 yuan ran away

17
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:29,060
Why are you so anxious to investigate me?

18
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:30,690
Thirty-four years old

19
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:33,050
Major safety accident occurred at Chengdong construction site

20
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,530
Went in on name.

21
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,570
It's your brother-in-law

22
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,130
The 3rd of last month

23
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:39,010
You took care of four people to persuade the right group

24
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,130
Workers blocking the door to ask for wages

25
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:43,300
They are still doing this in the hospital now

26
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,940
Even my wife doesn't know

27
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,180
how could she know

28
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,570
Who is it?

29
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,440
This morning at 7:20

30
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,550
You are at the breakfast shop at the entrance of the community

31
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:53,710
Ate a bowl of won rice

32
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:56,180
One fried dough stick eight point and five

33
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,100
Entering company

34
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,300
Do you want me to continue?
